<title>THAILAND: Samaggi Insurance to pay 5 baht div.</title>
<headline>Samaggi Insurance to pay 5 baht div.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dividend for year ending December 31, 1996:</p>
<p>			  Twelve months</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  5.00     vs     6.25</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 March 10, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	April 8, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Samaggi Insurance Plc, an insurance firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
